00:06:21.729 --> 00:06:23.469
Mayor Pete just doesn't allow it.

00:06:23.469 --> 00:06:26.520
I also appreciated that she stood up for American
troops.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:31.770
You know, the president, United States calling
those who served suckers and losers, saying

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:35.659
