00:06:36.849 --> 00:06:42.189
But, Mayor, you know, the president who wants
to serve knows what Section 60 means and indeed,

00:06:42.189 --> 00:06:45.999
in the way he talked about the, you know,
folks like John McCain.

00:06:45.999 --> 00:06:51.460
I hate to interrupt you, but, you know, the
president has denied that particular story.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:52.460
Right.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.800
But we know he's lying because, you know,
even in the middle of his term, you know,

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.120
he's Lundestad said, I never called.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:59.939
Well, because part of his denial was he said,
I never called John McCain a loser.

00:06:59.939 --> 00:07:03.830
And anybody with Twitter can go and see where
he did so to believe that he was lying and

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.900
that part of his sentence, but not another
part.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:10.900
Remember, this is the guy who back when he
was a wealthy young man in New York, born

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.039
