00:07:21.639 --> 00:07:22.639
All right.

00:07:22.639 --> 00:07:23.699
Really, really good stuff.

00:07:23.699 --> 00:07:27.370
I mean, really just a clinic on how to deal
with Fox News.

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:29.960
And in each of those clips, you see something
